title: Defend the Revolution
card-image: img/cards/domestic_enemies.svg?v=2
subtitle: The Whites are advancing. Where does the party stand?
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: soviet_affairs
view-if: domestic_enemies_timer <= 0 and dix >= 34
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; domestic_enemies_timer = 3

Whatever our quarrel with the Bolsheviks, a victory for Kolchak or Denikin would mean the end of every labour organisation, and of every socialist party. The question is what to do about it. (The front: [+ white_front : front +].)

- @mobilise: Send our members to the Red Army, as a gesture of loyalty.
- @neither: Say that we are for neither side.
- @conditions: Support the defence, if the prisoners are released first.
- @easy_discard

@mobilise
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_army += 5;
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3, rel_bol: 4, soviet_democracy: -1});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, soldiers: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 1);
Q.defended = (Q.defended || 0) + 1;
if (Q.legality < 3 && Q.defended >= 2 && Q.dix >= 66) { Q.legality += 1; }
!}

Our members enlisted in the Red Army and our veterans took commissions. The Bolsheviks have noticed, and some of the arrests have stopped.

@neither

How should it be carried out? Phased in, with compensation and negotiation, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. By decree it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can pass it and enforce it against them.

- @neither_slow: Phase it in, with compensation and negotiation.
- @neither_decree: Pass it by decree, as written.
- @neither_force: Pass it by decree, and break any opposition by force.

@neither_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {middle: 2, peasants: 1});
RO.add(Q, {repression: 1, rel_bol: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 5);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
}, "Say that we are for neither side");
!}

"Neither Kolchak nor Lenin." The slogan is exact, and it gives satisfaction to nobody who is on a front. It was phased in slowly, with compensation where it was owed, and the opposition grumbled rather than raged.



@neither_decree
subtitle: The law as written. Its opponents will answer.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'decree', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {middle: 2, peasants: 1});
RO.add(Q, {repression: 1, rel_bol: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 5);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
}, "Say that we are for neither side");
!}

"Neither Kolchak nor Lenin." The slogan is exact, and it gives satisfaction to nobody who is on a front.



@neither_force
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Chance of breaking its opponents: Bolsheviks [+ odds_bol +]%. A camp under 45% is too strong to touch, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'force', () => {
RO.boost(Q, {middle: 2, peasants: 1});
RO.add(Q, {repression: 1, rel_bol: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 5);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
}, "Say that we are for neither side");
!}

"Neither Kolchak nor Lenin." The slogan is exact, and it gives satisfaction to nobody who is on a front. [+ law_text +]

@conditions
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_army += 3;
RO.add(Q, {repression: -2, rel_bol: 1});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 1});
Q.prisoner_deal = 1;
!}

We offered support for the defence of the cities, if a dozen of our imprisoned leaders were freed. Some were; others were not.
